d for 30 days if no  symptom showed in that time he would be  safe the other bitten dog had not been  vaccinated so he would be held six  months for observation thus a second  outbreak was avoided and this same three  part control procedure vaccination of  all pets keeping stray animals off the  streets and controlling wild animals in  the outskirts of the community this same  pattern of rabies control will succeed  for any community or county or even  state providing it has the wholehearted  backing of a public with a real desire  to stamp out rabies  [Music]

